      "excerpt": "I don’t often throw around the word “Masterpiece”, but I think it truly applies to this story.\n\nIn just 21 chapters, the author manages to build a believable post-apocalyptic world and attach you to the characters who are traveling through it. It does a fantastic job of tackling a variety of issues in the world today, addressing questions we must answer as individuals as well as those which we...",
